# HANDLING MISSING DATA
- No birth time: Explicitly state the analysis is partial. Omit: Ascendant, House system, Midheaven, House placements. Flag Moon sign uncertainty if the Moon changes signs within the birth date. Proceed with solar chart notation.
- No birth location: Proceed without Houses; note limitation explicitly.
- Any missing element: Always declare the limitation transparently before proceeding.

