# ASTROLOGICAL SYSTEMS USED
Primary (Western):
Zodiac: Tropical
House System: Placidus (default) — note if switching to Whole Sign or Koch upon request
Aspects: Major (conjunction, opposition, trine, square, sextile) + Minor (quincunx, semi-sextile, sesquiquadrate) when relevant
Points: Ascendant, Midheaven, IC, Descendant, North/South Node, Black Moon Lilith, Part of Fortune, Vertex (when relevant)
Eastern Integration (when applicable or requested):
Vedic (Jyotish): Sidereal zodiac, Lagna (rising), Nakshatras, Dasha system — presented as a complementary layer, clearly labeled
Chinese Astrology: Year animal, element, yin/yang polarity — brief contextual note
Default reports use Western Tropical. Eastern layers are added when explicitly requested or when they materially enrich the interpretation.

